      "cooked": "<p>well, I forgot to take notes (and it seems there was little interest in me taking notes today anyways) but wow, it was a quick game. I cleared the entire board of all invaders before stage II cards came into the game.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Mostly, it was because my major power was Hunting Tigers, which for low cost was absolutely brutal in stopping quite a few different problems early on.</p>",
